msgctxt "Operator"
msgid "Toggle the camera grid overlay.\n\nShortcuts (Over-Grid):\nClick / Wheel / Arrows - Switch camera.\nClick+Drag - Quick-switch through cameras.\nSelect+Drag - Paint-select cameras.\nCtrl+Wheel - Resize tiles.\nCtrl+Shift+1/2/3 - Switch display mode.\nF5 - Refresh previews."
msgstr "切换相机网格叠加层。\n\n快捷键（网格上）：\n单击 / 滚轮 / 方向键 - 切换相机。\n单击+拖拽 - 快速切换相机。\n选择+拖拽 - 涂抹选择相机。\nCtrl+滚轮 - 调整平铺大小。\nCtrl+Shift+1/2/3 - 切换显示模式。\nF5 - 刷新预览。"
